---
import Experience from '../layouts/Experience.astro';
import { orgs } from '../data/profile';
---

<Experience org={orgs.keybank}>
  <p>
    I joined a brand-new platform at KeyBank on day one and helped build it from
    an empty repository into the bank's primary tool for opening business
    accounts. The application is built in <strong>Angular</strong> and <strong
      >TypeScript</strong
    >, and I've owned a good portion of the experience end to end.
  </p>

  <p>
    Most of the core flows passed through my hands at some point: the
    navigation, the progress tracker that keeps bankers oriented, product
    selection, the cart review, and the applicant forms that capture everything
    the bank needs to open an account.
  </p>

  <p>
    We shipped from an internal pilot to a nationwide rollout now used by <strong
      >1,500+ bankers</strong
    >. Along the way, the time it takes to open a business account dropped from
    over an hour to roughly ten minutes, a change people in branches actually
    feel every day.
  </p>
</Experience>
